{"id":1150,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>2024年3月14日下午，体育学院于15206H教室开展了2024届毕业生毕业季教育会议。院党委副书记贾鹏、学生科科长李士荣、辅导员李佳怿以及全体2024届毕业生参与会议。</p><p>会议中，贾书记嘱托毕业生们在毕业季期间要增强安全意识，继续严格遵守学校各项要求，详细掌握自身是否满足毕业条件，确保人身安全、交通安全、消防安全、财产安全、饮食安全，谨防电信诈骗，合理安排本学期的学习生活。针对就业事宜，他希望同学们确立正确的就业观，鼓励大家先就业再择业，尽快落实就业去向。</p><p>随后，李士荣老师和李佳怿老师强调了毕业论文、毕业设计、请销假管理、毕业学分要求、毕业季行为规范等方面的注意事项，并对国家大学生就业服务平台的使用进行了培训。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YnRG4DnNC4M4VRM84Q2MRffnz7sLRCi8Ml-PMNlZMlUYUzG0gihFp2hmCIa0oSybn1yDMYy8MmCanlUaozfkMl7ZU4N4MmW7L8QVLNCbL8nFM7CYMl-YLlVFLl-YUzCJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg47YMzNigtA8pUDcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=12595&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/99F674660ED090B5A8C9362D3FE2F93D/4F25B21A/1B2A6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YLzL4bMRMkLNUYL87-DU8U4UNVRL8Ci8MzTRol7soR-DM470gihFp2hmCIa0LYybL1yZLYyYLRUbnzMkMmA7nl-4LzTkoz-ZMNCPL4vYMRQFL878M4v8M8VFo7-Zoz9agtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8oSyPLmlbMSbw62D8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=12595&e=.jpg\">&nbsp; <img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YM4n4VLRCaUzvDn8RM7nNCbMzv4n7Ci4LRGsMmvDLlU4UmL0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yYUSyaU1yinzNbLRTVL7W2M8QRnzVkL4CDLR-iUmQfLNQFL4LZLmUiUmMFLzNPMmUJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg47YMzNigtA8pUDcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=12595&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/62A0B5E9909E0BF7FCE1B366025B6A2F/338245B3/19164\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YUzL48U4WkUNn7L88rkol-4LN7DozQifU4TRolCYn7n2Uz90gihFp2hmCIa0MkyZMkhVLkhkMlLPUmrVoR7bnzUiMlWVMl-4MznkozlZLlnFnN-YoRCZLlQFoR62oRLPgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8oSyPLmlbMSbw62D8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=12595&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YolW4VnzLDLRARo8R94Um6RnllPM8MifM47YU4LPLm98M4U0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyYn1yPLShfUm7inmU4LmGaMNnRMm7PnNlaMznfnlW2nNQFoz7DMz62nmrFLlLiozLJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg47YMzNigtA8pUDcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=12595&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/42F11AB15F432006DC611FE054AEBFFF/91657FF5/1C593\" vheight=\"\" vwi